ter System','NA',1,1,1,1,7,'1','2025-008, INTRATRUCTURE, TUPAX WATER SYSTEM','ORDINANCE  REGULATING THE OPERATION OF THE WATER SYSTEM AT \r\nBARANGAY TUPAX, THIS MUNICIPALITY, INCLUDING THE IMPOSITION OF FEES, \r\nCHARGES,  AND PRESCRIBING PENALTIES FOR VIOLATIONS THEREOF','2025-08-08 05:33:34','2025-08-08 05:33:34','3','2025-05-28 00:00:00'),(12,'Use of 2024 LDRRMF Balance for Water Project in Jones','NA',1,1,1,1,7,'1','2025-011, WATER PROJECT IN JONES, INFRASTRUCTURE','ORDINANCE AUTHORIZING THE USE OF THE CY 2024 LDRRMF UNEXPENDED \r\nBALANCE  AMOUNTING TO ONE MILLION SIXTY-EIGHT THOUSAND EIGHTEEN \r\nAND 61/100 PESOS (P1,068,018.61) AS ADDITIONAL FUND FOR THE \r\nCONSTRUCTION OF WATER SOURCE AND INSTALLATION OF WATER PIPELINE \r\nAT THE MUNICIPAL COMPOUND, BARANGAY 1 (POBLACION), JONES, ISABELA.','2025-08-08 05:35:37','2025-08-08 05:35:37','3','2025-07-02 00:00:00'),(13,'Adoption of Safe Spaces Act_Bawal bastos Ordinance','NA',1,1,1,1,8,'1','2025-003, BAWAL BASTOS, PEACE & ORDER','ORDINANCE ADOPTING REPUBLIC ACT NO. 11313, ENTITLED: “AN ACT DEFINING \r\nGENDER-BASED SEXUAL HARASSMENT (GBSH) IN THE STREETS, PUBLIC SPACES, \r\nWORKPLACES, ONLINE, EDUCATIONAL OR TRAINING INSTITUTIONS, PROVIDING \r\nPROTECTIVE MEASURES”, OTHERWISE KNOWN AS THE “SAFE SPACES ACT” AND \r\nITS IMPLEMENTING RULES AND REGULATIONS AND PRESCRIBING PENALTIES \r\nTHEREFOR FOR LOCAL IMPLEMENTATION IN THE MUNICIPALITY OF JONES, \r\nISABELA.','2025-08-08 05:37:36','2025-08-08 05:37:36','3','2025-01-22 00:00:00'),(14,'New rates - New Tricycle Fare Rates in Jones','NA',1,1,1,1,13,'1','2025-004, New Tricycle Fare Rates, Transportation & Communication','ORDINANCE PRESCRIBING A NEW FARE RATES OF MOTORIZED TRICYCLES FOR \r\nHIRE OPERATING IN THE MUNICIPALITY OF JONES, ISABELA, REPEALING \r\nORDINANCE NOS. 2010-002 AND  2017-042 FOR THE PURPOSE.','2025-08-08 05:39:35','2025-08-08 05:39:35','3','2025-02-10 00:00:00'),(15,'Land Reclassification from Agricultural to Commercial','NA',1,1,1,1,1,'1','2024-009, Agricultural to Commercial, Agricultural & Cooperatives','ORDINANCE RECLASSIFYING A PARCEL OF LAND OWNED BY  MR. EDITO A. \r\nCURAMENG  LOCATED AT DIBULUAN, JONES, ISABELA, COVERING AN AREA OF 225 \r\nSQUARE METERS MORE OR LESS FROM AGRICULTURAL TO COMMERCIAL LOT.','2025-08-08 06:07:29','2025-08-08 06:07:29','3','2024-03-01 00:00:00'),(16,'Land Reclassification for Casa de Jonesians Project','NA',1,1,1,1,1,'1','2024-21, Casa de Jonesians Project, Agricultural & Cooperatives','ORDINANCE RECLASSIFYING A PARCEL OF LAND LOCATED AT BARANGAY SAN \r\nISIDRO, JONES, ISABELA OWNED BY MR. RENATO MARTINEZ COVERING AN AREA \r\nOF 25,000 SQUARE METERS MORE OR LESS FROM AGRICULTURAL TO RESIDENTIAL \r\nLOT FOR THE PROPOSED CASA DE JONESIANS.','2025-08-08 06:09:14','2025-08-08 06:09:14','3','2024-05-22 00:00:00'),(17,'Integration of Cultural and Gender Sensitivity in School Curriculum','NA',1,1,1,1,2,'1','2024-013, Cultural and Gender Sensitivity, Arts & Culture','ORDINANCE PROMOTING CULTURAL AND GENDER SENSITIVITY: INTEGRATING \r\nLESSONS ON WOMEN AND FAMILY RIGHTS, AND INCORPORATING MAKABAYAN \r\nSONGS SUCH AS THE JONES MARCH, PINILISA SONG, HIMIG NG REHIYONG \r\nDALAWA, MARTSA NG PAMPAARALANG SANGAY NG ISABELA, AND OTHERS, INTO \r\nRELEVANT SUBJECTS WITHIN THE SCHOOL CURRICULUM OF ALL LEARNING \r\nINSTITUTIONS IN THE MUNICIPALITY OF JONES, ISABELA.','2025-08-08 06:12:46','2025-08-08 06:12:46','3','2025-03-27 00:00:00'),(18,'Behavioral Nudges Installation in Key Areas','NA',1,1,1,1,3,'1','2024-014, Behavioral Nudges, Education','ORDINANCE  ENACTING THE INSTALLATION AND MAINTENANCE OF BEHAVIORAL \r\nNUDGES IN PRIORITY SETTINGS IN THE MUNICIPALITY OF JONES, ISABELA','2025-08-08 06:15:20','2025-08-08 06:15:20','3','2024-03-27 00:00:00'),(19,'Approval of 2024 Supplemental Budget No. 1','NA',1,1,1,1,5,'1','2024-002, 2024 Supplemental Budget, Good Governance','ORDINANCE AUTHORIZING SUPPLEMENTAL BUDGET NO. 01 SERIES OF 2024 OF THE \r\nMUNICIPALITY OF JONES, ISABELA, INVOLVING AN AMOUN